      "combineNotes": "The Fi axis is one dense coder plus one sparse recovery coder. The entity list exists because plot summaries name gods rather than describing them mythically, so it recovers myth that the lexicon cannot see; it is not a second opinion about episodes the lexicon already scores. Averaging would let its many zeros pull down the lexicon's hits, so the axis takes the strongest evidence either coder sees. Set combine to \"weighted\" to average them instead.",
